      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/65b543/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-06-27T00:58:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Sorry couldn’t anything in the fireside chat, but is Environmental Allies suppose to protect the heroes from a destroyed Explosive Wagon?</p><p>I only ask because the wording on Wagons is “When this target is destroyed, deal each target 2 fire...” &nbsp;</p><p>If the wording were “When this target is destroyed, this card deals each target 2 fire...” then it would be clear that Environmental Allies should work.</p><p>Without the words “this card”, it seems like it is the environment that is dealing the damage, not the wagon (i.e., it is similar to the wording used in Sustain the Portal).</p><p>Thanks,</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:25.920Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
