      "created_at": "2018-06-27T01:05:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The Explosive Wagon is the source of the damage and it’s an environment target. &nbsp;Sustain the Portal is also the source of the damage when it’s damage is dealt. &nbsp;I can understand the wording question but unless the card explicitly states a different source is dealing the damage the card itself is the one in control of that damage. &nbsp;</p>",
