      "created_at": "2018-06-27T13:53:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think it's been changed in reprints, but Horrid Cacophony (in the Matriarch's deck) used to just say to deal heroes damage, without specifying it was supposed to be Lilian who was doing it. I think this kind of stuff is probably just something that's sort of been shaped better over time, when back in the early days consistency of wording wasn't given quite as much thought, perhaps. But yeah, a Gazelle-powered Environmental Allies makes Silver Gulch a wonderful place to be ;).</p>",
